---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro'; import { sources } from '../../lib/data';
---
<Base title="Discovery Sources — Islamic Tech Guide"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Provenance</div><h1 class="page-title">Discovery Sources</h1><p>Aggregated lists and repositories are tracked here instead of being treated as archive Resources.</p></div></div><div class="notice">Discovery provenance answers <strong>“where did we find it?”</strong>. Evidence answers <strong>“how do we know this claim is true?”</strong>.</div><div class="source-grid">{sources.map((s:any)=><article class="card source-card"><div class="meta"><span class="tag accent">{s.type||'source'}</span><span class="source-status">{s.processing?.status||'unknown'}</span>{s.demo&&<span class="tag demo">DEMO</span>}</div><h3>{s.name}</h3><p>{s.notes?.[0]||'Discovery source'}</p><p><a href={s.url} target="_blank">Open source ↗</a></p><div class="source-metrics"><div><strong>{s.processing?.discovered_items??'—'}</strong><span>discovered</span></div><div><strong>{s.processing?.accepted_items??'—'}</strong><span>accepted</span></div><div><strong>{s.processing?.deferred_items??'—'}</strong><span>deferred</span></div><div><strong>{s.processing?.dead_items??'—'}</strong><span>dead</span></div><div><strong>{s.processing?.duplicate_items??'—'}</strong><span>duplicate</span></div></div><div class="facts"><div class="fact"><small>First checked</small>{s.processing?.first_checked_at||'—'}</div><div class="fact"><small>Last checked</small>{s.processing?.last_checked_at||'—'}</div><div class="fact"><small>Content extracted</small>{String(Boolean(s.processing?.content_extracted))}</div>{s.processing?.sections_processed&&<div class="fact"><small>Sections processed</small>{s.processing.sections_processed.join(' · ')}</div>}{s.processing?.sections_pending&&<div class="fact"><small>Sections pending</small>{s.processing.sections_pending.join(' · ')}</div>}</div></article>)}</div></Base>
